  "reconciliation_base": "0cfff1d274ecc4554d0af8af1c7b1c7908595e96",
  "reconciliation_note": "The previous import had no pinned source record. This commit matched its normalized upstream files except the preserved host changes; it was used as the three-way merge base, not asserted as the original import revision.",
  "normalization": "Map each upstream crate to native_* internal modules, lib.rs to mod.rs, crate/external paths to internal modules, wgpu to bgi_wgpu, and MPEG to the workspace codec; format Rust with edition 2024 and skip_children=true.",
  "local_changes": [
    "CrySirror-owned session worker, immutable completed CPU frames and session-owned 48 kHz stereo PCM.",
    "Keep host-selected bootstrap, font, input/dialog handling and installed-resource view.",
    "Primary-root native writes use the existing private user overlay; this subsumes the upstream BGI.gdb alias while keeping the resource directory read-only. The upstream narrow-write-whitelist-only test addition is not imported.",
    "Keep existing GPU namespace, file-policy/platform seams and MPEG codec boundary; no standalone upstream launcher or audio device is enabled."
  ],
